# Xcode / build artifacts for the NoteworthyLive app.
# The .xcodeproj is generated by `xcodegen generate` from project.yml,
# but is kept tracked so the project opens after clone. Per-user state and
# build output below are volatile and must not be committed.

# Per-user Xcode UI state
**/xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate

# Build output / derived data
build/
DerivedData/

# Local secrets (none expected, but never commit signing material)
*.p8
*.p12
*.cer
*.mobileprovision
